Subject: Use the maintained Fetch Metadata CSRF implementation
Origin: DHI-internal (CVE remediation)
Description: Replace ZITADEL Login V1's unmaintained github.com/gorilla/csrf import and module requirement with the maintained filippo.io/csrf/gorilla compatibility package.
CVE: CVE-2025-47909
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel.git a8b256c94b6d8615f12c05c54289600a06ca1912
Verify: cmd `go test ./internal/api/ui/login/...` expect "ok"
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI package dependency remediation)
Drop-When: never: upstream v4.20.3 go.mod still requires github.com/gorilla/csrf v1.7.2, so Login V1 keeps the unmaintained import until upstream moves off it

---
diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@ require (
 	connectrpc.com/grpcreflect v1.3.0
 	connectrpc.com/otelconnect v0.9.0
 	dario.cat/mergo v1.0.2
+	filippo.io/csrf v0.2.1
 	github.com/BurntSushi/toml v1.6.0
 	github.com/DATA-DOG/go-sqlmock v1.5.2
 	github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/opentelemetry-operations-go/exporter/metric v0.56.0
@@ -42,7 +43,6 @@ require (
 	github.com/golang/protobuf v1.5.4
 	github.com/google/go-cmp v0.7.0
 	github.com/google/uuid v1.6.0
-	github.com/gorilla/csrf v1.7.2
 	github.com/gorilla/mux v1.8.1
 	github.com/gorilla/schema v1.4.1
 	github.com/gorilla/securecookie v1.1.2
diff --git a/internal/api/ui/login/login.go b/internal/api/ui/login/login.go
index e9908f92a..04f915d1f 100644
--- a/internal/api/ui/login/login.go
+++ b/internal/api/ui/login/login.go
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@ import (
 	"strings"
 	"time"
 
-	"github.com/gorilla/csrf"
+	csrf "filippo.io/csrf/gorilla"
 	"github.com/gorilla/mux"
 
 	"github.com/zitadel/zitadel/internal/api/authz"
